graph TD
    PID["PID poller 1s"] --> CHK{Changed?}
    CHK -->|new PID| SPAWN["Spawn: adb logcat --pid=PID"]
    CHK -->|PID gone| KILL["Kill subprocess"]
    CHK -->|same| NOP[ ]

    SPAWN --> BUF["Rolling buffer (1000 lines)"]
    BUF --> FILTER["Filter: tag + search + level"]
    FILTER --> RENDER["Render with highlights + scroll"]
